A Subcommittee on Counterterrorism and Intelligence markup to consider the following measures:

H.R. 7443, (Mr. Pfluger) the “I&A Mission Reorientation Act of 2026”;

H.R. 7764, (Mr. Evans of CO) the “National Threat Evaluation and Reporting Program Reassignment and Funding Reform Act of 2026”;

H.R. 7574, (Mr. Evans of CO) the “ELO Realignment and Strategic Engagement Reform Act of 2026”;

H.R. 8142 (Mr. Mackenzie) the “Special Events Program Alignment Act of 2026”;

H.R. 7448, (Ms. Pou) the “Modernizing and Improving the National Terrorism Advisory System Act of 2026”;

H.R. 7427, (Mr. Goldman) the “Securing Access from Foreign Entities Visiting Internal Sites in the States Act” or “SAFE VISITS Act”; and

H.R. 7436, (Mr. Magaziner) the “Department of Homeland Security Intelligence and Analysis Training Act”.”

Learn more at homeland.house.gov

